msgstr "Galluogi Meysydd Ychwanegol"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Add content-type specific additional tags (event statuses, project statuses, etc.) based on thesaurus content type."
msgstr "Ychwanegwch feysydd ychwanegol penodol math cynnwys (statws digwyddiad, statws prosiect, ac ati) yn seiliedig ar fath cynnwys thesawrws."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Additional Tags Mapping"
msgstr "Mapio Meysydd Ychwanegol"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
