msgstr "Bydd gan y mathau canlynol o gynnwys y meysydd ychwanegol hyn ar gael:"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Event Statuses"
msgstr "Statws Digwyddiad"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Project Statuses, Geographic Scopes"
msgstr "Statws Prosiect, Cwmpasau Daearyddol"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Ministry (8)"
msgstr "Y Weinyddiaeth (8)"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Organization Types, Government Types"
msgstr "Mathau o Sefydliadau, Mathau Llywodraeth"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Ecosystem (9)"
msgstr "Ecosystem (9)"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Ecosystem Types"
msgstr "Mathau Ecosystem"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Document Types"
msgstr "Mathau o Ddogfennau"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "These tags are dynamically added based on the selected content type and are powered by a Vue.js component."
msgstr "Mae'r meysydd hyn yn cael eu hychwanegu'n ddeinamig yn seiliedig ar y math o gynnwys a ddewiswyd ac yn cael eu pweru gan gydran Vue.js."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Auto Summary"
msgstr "Galluogi Crynodeb Auto"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically generate summary from body content as user types."
msgstr "Cynhyrchu crynodeb yn awtomatig o gynnwys corff fel mathau o ddefnyddwyr."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Help Comments"
msgstr "Galluogi Sylwadau Cymorth Maes"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Display contextual help comments for fields based on content type."
msgstr "Arddangos sylwadau cymorth cyd-destunol ar gyfer meysydd yn seiliedig ar y math o gynnwys."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Menu Depth Restriction"
msgstr "Galluogi Cyfyngiad Dyfnder Dewis"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Restrict non-administrator users from creating second-level menu items and deeper. Only users with \"administer menu\" permission can create nested menu items."
msgstr "Cyfyngu defnyddwyr nad ydynt yn weinyddwr rhag creu eitemau dewislen ail lefel ac yn ddyfnach. Dim ond defnyddwyr sydd â chaniatâd “gweinyddu bwydlen” sy'n gallu creu eitemau dewislen nythu."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Translation Defaults"
msgstr "Rhagosodiadau Cyfieithu"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Configure creation of translation defaults (language placeholders) for translatable entities."
msgstr "Ffurfweddu creu rhagosodiadau cyfieithu (deiliaid lleoedd iaith) ar gyfer endidau y gellir eu cyfieithu."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically create translation defaults"
msgstr "Creu rhagosodiadau cyfieithu yn awtomatig"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translation defaults (placeholders) are created for other languages at entity create/update. Existing translations with proper source are not overwritten."
msgstr "Pan gaiff ei alluogi, mae rhagosodiadau cyfieithu (deiliaid lleoedd) yn cael eu creu ar gyfer ieithoedd eraill yn endidau create/diweddaru. Nid yw cyfieithiadau presennol gyda ffynhonnell briodol yn cael eu trosysgrifo."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Use all available languages"
msgstr "Defnyddiwch yr holl ieithoedd sydd ar gael"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translations will be created for all languages installed on the site. When disabled, only the selected target languages below will be used."
msgstr "Pan gaiff eu galluogi, bydd cyfieithiadau yn cael eu creu ar gyfer yr holl ieithoedd sydd wedi'u gosod ar y safle. Pan fydd yn anabl, dim ond yr ieithoedd targed a ddewiswyd isod fydd yn cael eu defnyddio."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Target languages for translation defaults"
msgstr "Ieithoedd targed ar gyfer rhagosodiadau cyfieithu"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which languages to create translation defaults for. Used only when \"Use all available languages\" is disabled."
msgstr "Dewiswch pa ieithoedd i greu rhagosodiadau cyfieithu ar eu cyfer. Defnyddir dim ond pan fydd “Defnyddiwch yr holl ieithoedd sydd ar gael” wedi'i analluogi."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Copy source field values"
msgstr "Copïwch werthoedd maes ffynhonnell"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translatable field values from the source language will be copied to new translations."
msgstr "Pan gaiff eu galluogi, bydd gwerthoedd maes y gellir eu cyfieithu o'r iaith ffynhonnell yn cael eu copïo i gyfieithiadau newydd."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity types"
msgstr "Mathau o endid"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "(Required)"
msgstr "(Gofynnol)"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "<strong>Required:</strong> Select which entity types should have translation defaults created. You must select at least one entity type for automatic translation defaults to work. Common choice: <em>Content (node)</em>."
msgstr "<strong>Angenrheidiol:</strong> Dewiswch pa fathau o endid ddylai fod â rhagosodiadau cyfieithu wedi&#39;u creu. Rhaid i chi ddewis o leiaf un math o endid er mwyn i ddiffygion cyfieithu awtomatig weithio. Dewis cyffredin: <em>Cynnwys (nod)</em>."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "You must select at least one entity type for automatic translation defaults to work. Please select one or more entity types, or disable \"Automatically create translation defaults\"."
msgstr "Rhaid i chi ddewis o leiaf un math o endid er mwyn i ddiffygion cyfieithu awtomatig weithio. Dewiswch un neu fwy o fathau o endid, neu analluogwch “Creu rhagosodiadau cyfieithu yn awtomatig”."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Batch Operations"
msgstr "Gweithrediadau Swp"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Process existing entities to create missing translation defaults."
msgstr "Prosesu endidau presennol i greu rhagosodiadau cyfieithu sydd ar goll."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity type to process"
msgstr "Math o endid i'w brosesu"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "- Select -"
msgstr "- Dewiswch -"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select an entity type to create translations for existing entities."
msgstr "Dewiswch fath o endid i greu cyfieithiadau ar gyfer endidau presennol."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Create translation defaults for existing entities"
msgstr "Creu rhagosodiadau cyfieithu ar gyfer endidau presennol"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Please select an entity type to process."
msgstr "Dewiswch fath endid i'w brosesu."

